If you wanted to keep the exterior assignment, I'd write a helper function:

```R
version_label <- function(mode, bs_version) {
  if (mode %in% c("release", "default")) {
    if (bs_version == 3) {
      "default" 
    } else {
      "info"
    }
  } else {
    "danger"
  }
}
